  "body": "https://quirks.spec.whatwg.org/commit-snapshots/a71b2bf7dff6f32f7f66edbafe016d824ff2100f/#the-unitless-length-quirk\r\n\r\nPer https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/6100 we've upstreamed the definition of `<quirky-length>` to CSS Values and Units Level 4: https://www.w3.org/TR/css-values-4/#deprecated-quirky-length\r\n\r\nIf the result looks good, the spec can replace the corresponding section with a reference to V&U.",
